'''Lucky Ice Pop''' (Japanese: '''当たりつきアイス''' ''Lucky Ice'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Heal 20 damage from your Active Pokémon. If you healed any damage in this way, flip a coin. If heads, put this Lucky Ice Pop into your hand instead of the discard pile.
}}

==Trivia==
*This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Lucky Ice Pop}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].
===Origin===
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Lucky Ice Pop|150}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.

